DESCRIPTION:Thu 29 Oct 4:00 pm – Tue 3 Nov 2026\n\nA quiet opening. The 
 exhibition in the Annexe is up from 4 pm and people drift between that an
 d the main building\; at 6:30 everyone settles into the auditorium for th
 e keynote — roughly an hour of illustrated lecture\, then questions. Th
 e evening breaks up around 8.\n\nSource: https://iicdelhi.in/
